**Read:** Complete the primary sources for all three investigations below. Use [Manufacturing history and measured residual strain — AM-Bench 2018](../sources/Additive-Manufacturing-Residual-Strain-AM-Bench.lingua#r_1JF3D3C7YNFKCJET729ADPZWPM) and [Mesoscale tensile blind predictions — AM-Bench 2022](../sources/Mesoscale-Tensile-Blind-Predictions-AM-Bench.lingua#r_72TG9WD15YP5DCTVCCX26W7FND) for manufactured metal, [Simultaneous rheology and cure kinetics — Romberg and Kotula, 2023](../sources/Rheology-and-Cure-Kinetics-Romberg-Kotula.lingua#r_17JNF4M1B6SKKEWAMQAXB3B614) and [Epoxy conversion from rheology — Romberg and colleagues, 2024](../sources/Epoxy-Conversion-Models-Romberg-and-Colleagues.lingua#r_2P4B2NBQT7APB3CQ2KDQ6MGMX0) for thermosets, and [Atomic layer deposition — surface chemistry and evidence](../sources/Atomic-Layer-Deposition-Chemistry-and-Evidence.lingua#r_43RJYA2HWF0DWTRB766G062RHV) for functional interfaces. Revisit the full earlier source books, including [Life-cycle assessment, detailed guidance — ILCD Handbook](../sources/Life-Cycle-Assessment-Detailed-Guide-ILCD.lingua#r_6YXH2DKX7XZRCE6XSCJ2QGJ3YX), as their questions become necessary.

Carry out all three investigations. Each should connect preparation, state, observation, a physical account, independent numerical checks, a changed-condition prediction and a functional decision. Their distinct materials expose different weaknesses in a universal-looking method. A polished review of the sources is insufficient without working through their evidence and limitations.

The studies branch here and meet at a common review. Work in an order that makes productive use of the shared foundations. Link earlier calculations directly and extend them where needed; there is no separate package, certification or software gate.

**Deliver:** Three inspectable accounts, each with a specific reproduced result or a precisely diagnosed reproduction limit, competing explanations and revisions. Track manufacturing inputs, useful output, service consequences and eventual recovery without inventing missing process inventories.

**Return:** [Materials engineering — structure, processing and useful behavior](../Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9).
**Continue in materials engineering:** [Integrated study of manufacturing strain and local plasticity](Integrated-study-of-manufacturing-strain-and-local-plasticity.lingua#r_4TCVYJ9EVP1RWV2BQ3SG800H3X), [Integrated study of cure history and retained function](Integrated-study-of-cure-history-and-retained-function.lingua#r_32ZJ0240BETP97ER2ADQGYQH57), [Integrated study of functional films and interfaces](Integrated-study-of-functional-films-and-interfaces.lingua#r_5MTVZKQD6SKNNR4J2W80C0274Y).

